 "notes": [
  "Gen 4 Doubles OU: Krabby's Knock Off hits a level 1 Volbeat at full HP holding a Focus Sash. Gen 4's sash holds the move silently (the `focussash` volatile's `onDamage`) and is used once it is over (`onAfterMoveSecondary`), but Knock Off took it first (`-enditem|p2b: Nick30|Focus Sash|[from] move: Knock Off`), so the log never shows the hold. The replay took the missing `-enditem|p|Focus Sash` for no hold and refused every roll under which the engine's sash held, as it did (R-M11-129; probe135, m9-gen4doublesou-s511-014)"
